Z||000008||Old Lar||11-06-2000||07:32 AM||||FOCOA produced a calendar for 1994 and this was one of the Fiero photos from the calendar which I scanned in (stole the picture).  But it is a real nice looking car.  As Oreif said wishful thinking for an IROC car.<P>You can build it if you have the $$$.  You can build anything if you have the $$$.<p>[This message has been edited by Old Lar (edited 11-06-2000).]||||reg||3
